  <item>
    <title>Vol.066 关于mbti：J/P属性大爆发！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65b9b6e96a43241529d56217</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65b9b6e96a43241529d56217</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 31 Jan 2024 09:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在一月的最后一天，更新虽迟但到！</span></p><span></span><p><span>曾经我们聊过i人e人相关的话题，这一次，我们来聊聊j人和p人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当出行必须按照计划行事的j人遇上随心所欲、不爱束缚的p人，这是一种互补还是互斥？</span></p><span></span><p><span>j人和p人到底有没有可能互相转变？</span></p><span></span><p><span>j人你们就一定要做计划吗？！</span></p><span></span><p><span>p人你们是真的不着急吗？！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目，纯血j人小留和顺子邀请到了p人嘉宾——财务王姐，在王姐忙碌的年前工作之余，和我们一起聊一聊生活中那些j/p属性大爆发的时刻。</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后，提前祝大家新年快乐，我们2月再见～</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜选曲｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>《蝴蝶》——陶喆</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜时间戳｜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="52">00:52</a> 正片从这里开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="186">03:06</a> 关于生活方式：标准可控or开放灵活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="299">04:59</a> 俺们J/P属性大爆发的几个场景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="433">07:13</a> 爆发场景之回消息的速度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1084">18:04</a> 爆发场景之出行安排</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1870">31:10</a> 爆发场景之开销计划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3433">57:13</a> 承认吧！J人P人你们离不开彼此</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜本期参与｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：小留｜顺子</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：财务王姐</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：吴雨桓</span></p><span></span><p><span>运营：徐瑞妍</span></p>]]></description>
