  <item>
    <title>Vol.057 年轻人租房指南：选房经验、玄学要点一网打尽ft.不敢高声语</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65029c985c88d24126db0982</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65029c985c88d24126db0982</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 14 Sep 2023 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们终于迎来了第二次的节目串台！撒花！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目，顺子邀请到了《不敢高声语》的Susu&amp;Ania来到《多云转晴》的录制间，就“年轻人如何租到满意的房子”这一瞄准打工人痛点的话题，和我们一起分享各类实用Tips。</span></p><span></span><p><span>不管是搬了几次家、踩过几次雷的实操经验，还是玄学方面的风水禁忌，我们都将一网打尽！</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你对这个话题感兴趣的话，不要犹豫，快来收听！同时也欢迎大家在评论区和我们分享你的tips，我们一起努力租到满意的房子！</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果想要加入听友群，可以搜索并关注微信公众号【万物FM】，会有小助手邀请你进群，记得备注“多云转晴”哦。</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜时间戳｜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="13">00:13</a> 风水初入门，资深打工人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="82">01:22</a> 公寓vs住宅，各有利弊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="571">09:31</a> 如何选到合适的房子？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="973">16:13</a> 看房要相信自己的直觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1072">17:52</a> 验房checklist听这里！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1724">28:44</a> 租房需要准备多少钱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2385">39:45</a> 重要提醒：不要在家里囤纸箱！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a> 一些需要提前和房东确认的问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3613">60:13</a> 租房风水之选房</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3999">66:39</a> 租房风水之搬家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4117">68:37</a> 租房风水之入住</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4944">82:24</a> 财不入脏门，勤打扫啊朋友们！</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜本期参与｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>串台主播：Susu｜Ania</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目主播：小留｜顺子</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：吴雨桓</span></p><span></span><p><span>运营：徐瑞妍</span></p>]]></description>
